	author = {Robinson, David and Hayes, Alex and Couch, Simon and Hvitfeldt, Emil and Software, Posit and PBC [cph and fnd and Patil, Indrajeet and Chiu, Derek and Gomez, Matthieu and Demeshev, Boris and Menne, Dieter and Nutter, Benjamin and Johnston, Luke and Bolker, Ben and Briatte, Francois and Arnold, Jeffrey and Gabry, Jonah and Selzer, Luciano and Simpson, Gavin and Preussner, Jens and Hesselberth, Jay and Wickham, Hadley and Lincoln, Matthew and Gasparini, Alessandro and Komsta, Lukasz and Novometsky, Frederick and Freitas, Wilson and Evans, Michelle and Brunson, Jason Cory and Jackson, Simon and Whalley, Ben and Whiting, Karissa and Rosseel, Yves and Kuehn, Michael and Cimentada, Jorge and Holgersen, Erle and Werner, Karl Dunkle and Christensen, Ethan and Pav, Steven and PJ, Paul and Schneider, Ben and Kennedy, Patrick and Medina, Lily and Fannin, Brian and Muhlenkamp, Jason and Lehman, Matt and Denney, Bill and Crane, Nic and Bates, Andrew and Arel-Bundock, Vincent and Hayashi, Hideaki and Tobalina, Luis and Wang, Annie and Tham, Wei Yang and Wang, Clara and Smith, Abby and Cooper, Jasper and Krauska, E. Auden and Wang, Alex and Barrett, Malcolm and Gray, Charles and Wilber, Jared and Gegzna, Vilmantas and Szoecs, Eduard and Aust, Frederik and Moore, Angus and Williams, Nick and Barth, Marius and Wundervald, Bruna and Cahoon, Joyce and McDermott, Grant and Zarca, Kevin and Kuriwaki, Shiro and Wallrich, Lukas and Martherus, James and Xiao, Chuliang and Larmarange, Joseph and Kuhn, Max and Bojanowski, Michal and Malmedal, Hakon and Wang, Clara and Oller, Sergio and Sonnet, Luke and Hester, Jim and Schneider, Ben and Gray, Bernie and Averick, Mara and Jacobs, Aaron and Bender, Andreas and Templer, Sven and Buerkner, Paul-Christian and Kay, Matthew and Pennec, Erwan Le and Junkka, Johan and Zhu, Hao and Soltoff, Benjamin and Saldana, Zoe Wilkinson and Littlefield, Tyler and Gray, Charles T. and Banks, Shabbh E. and Robinson, Serina and Bivand, Roger and Ots, Rii